{"id":"tq_0301","question":"A man pushes his car to a hotel and tells the owner he's bankrupt. Why?","answer":"He's playing Monopoly","answer_note":"In Monopoly, landing on a hotel property and being unable to pay makes you bankrupt.","category":"lateral thinking","difficulty":"medium","hook":"What game involves cars, hotels, and bankruptcy?"},
