{"id":"tq_0310","question":"How do you make the number one disappear by adding to it?","answer":"Add the letter G — 'Gone'","answer_note":"Adding 'G' to 'one' spells 'gone' — the number one has disappeared.","category":"wordplay","difficulty":"medium","hook":"Letters, not numbers, solve this..."},
